WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.504
Hi, I am Professor Vector. Let us win your first fight together.

2
00:00:06.564 --> 00:00:13.956
This is the Ore Slime. Every right answer is a hit on its health bar.

3
00:00:14.016 --> 00:00:22.294
Some questions you type. Some you build or pick. Read what this one asks.

4
00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:29.317
Do the math, then fire! A right answer knocks off some of its health.

5
00:00:29.377 --> 00:00:36.747
The light at the top turned green. Each light is one question.

6
00:00:36.807 --> 00:00:43.261
Now let us see what happens after a miss.

7
00:00:43.321 --> 00:00:50.281
A miss lets the slime hit back. But you choose how to come back.

8
00:00:50.341 --> 00:01:04.730
Try again for a full hit. Show me the picture for a half hit. Or train it in the Arcade and come back with a shield.

9
00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.604
Let us try again. This time, a full hit!

10
00:01:09.664 --> 00:01:17.916
The lamps down here show how many hits are left. Keep a streak going for a combo.

11
00:01:17.976 --> 00:01:25.426
That is how fights work. Your turn: start your first fight when you are ready!
